		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Larger than the largest roc, the gods send this six-winged eagle as divine retribution. Prefers to grab enemies and drop them.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 76, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 rend +10 (2d12 + grab) or 1 thunder bolt, <strong>MV</strong> far (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Divine</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gale</strong>. Wings create a hurricane wind within far, ranged weapons are useless.</p><p></p><p><strong>Grab</strong>. STR 18+ or target held. STR 18+ on turn to break free.</p><p></p><p><strong>Thunder Bolt</strong>. A pealing blast of thunder and lightning in a line (5' wide) extending far from the behemoth. DEX 18+ or 6d6 damage and deafened.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
